  "Interac e-Transfer is available in CAD only. Switch the currency to CAD to use it.": "Interac e-Transfer solo está disponible en CAD. Cambie la moneda a CAD para usarlo.",
  "03 — GENERATE ORDER": "03 — GENERAR ORDEN",
  "GENERATE ORDER →": "GENERAR ORDEN →",
  "Enter an amount above zero and choose a payment method first.": "Primero ingrese un monto mayor que cero y elija un método de pago.",
  "By generating an order, you agree to our": "Al generar una orden, usted acepta nuestros",
